218 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 115 0 R
/E (The repository has an indirect water footprint because data centres may consume water for cooling, while electricity generation also requires water. A direct data-centre cooling-water factor of 0.56 litres per kWh of IT electricity is used, producing an estimated cooling-water footprint of approximately 3.48 litres per semester. An indirect electricity-generation water factor of 1.04 litres per kWh is applied to the total data-centre electricity consumption, resulting in approximately 8.09 litres per semester. The combined operational water footprint is therefore estimated at approximately 11.57 litres per four-month semester. This should be described as a conservative illustrative estimate because actual water consumption depends on the data-centre location, cooling system, electricity source, and hosting provider.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
