/P 118 0 R
/E (This graph shows the estimated environmental reduction achieved by the TO-BE model. At a 4-kilometre return distance, carbon emissions decrease by approximately 92.67% to 96.42%, while at 16 kilometres the reduction increases to about 96.99% to 97.89%. The estimated water-footprint reduction is around 99.88%. This shows that the digital repository provides greater environmental benefits as the avoided travel distance increases.)
/Pg 20 0 R
